<title>UK: Gehe says has 72.87 pct of Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Gehe says has 72.87 pct of Lloyds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German pharmaceuticals group Gehe AG said on Tuesday its subsidiary Gehe Invest held 72.87 percent of the issued ordinary share capital of British chemists chain Lloyds Chemists Plc on January 20.</p>
<p>The company said Gehe Invest also agreed to buy an additional 5.50 percent of Lloyds Chemists ordinary shares.</p>
<p>Gehe clinched its year-long fight for Lloyds Chemists earlier this month after outgunning Britain's Unichem Plc with a bid worth 684 million pounds.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
